  "historyNote": "#2817, eff 8-16-84; EXPIRED: 8-16-90 New. #5224, eff 9-12-91, EXPIRED: 9-12-97 New. #7165, eff 12-18-99, EXPIRED: 12-18-07 New. #9502, eff 7-3-09, EXPIRED: 7-3-17 New. #12406, INTERIM, eff 10-24-17, EXPIRED: 4-22-18 New. #12519, eff 4-25-18",
